  "findings": [
    "Ordered native dispatch sequence binds exact captured prompt digest, reconstructed model body SHA256 and a preceding successful same-wire tokenizer request.",
    "Configured margin and retained reasoning are recomputed from receipts preceding the first cached tokenizer measurement; reservation equality and actual input/output caps are checked against8000total.",
    "All eight actual archives independently replay to the saved218-call/605550-token aggregate; result hashes match existing source bindings.",
    "Review supplies explicit config/code/source bindings around the replay artifact, which itself stores result hashes but not full source paths or implementation bindings."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Verifier checks supplied capture/receipt/dispatch streams, not independent census of missing external ledgers or provider effects; global completeness still requires sealed immutable source provenance.",
    "Margin and output profile come from the supplied cell; prospective freeze must bind intended profile. Actual replay uses512margin.",
